# Density Compare
# Palladium (Pd) — real density 12.02 g/cm³. equal masses: Palladium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Palladium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.7mm color: #d0a0a0 at (-20mm, 4.4mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 95.9 g — the water cube is the reference
